      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "幽靈屬性寶可夢的弱點是\n幽靈屬性和惡屬性……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳知道其中有什麼意涵嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E7D97485C6C60275BF653EF592276845F319EDE662F000A5E7D97485C6C6027548C60E15C6C60272026202600100001BE00000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B377E5905351764E2D67094EC09EBC610F6DB555CEFF1F00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "知道",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "77E590530000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不知道",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D77E590530000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "當幽靈屬性對上幽靈屬性，\n勝負的關鍵在於速度……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75765E7D97485C6C60275C0D4E0A5E7D97485C6C6027FF0C000A52DD8CA0768495DC9375572865BC901F5EA62026202600100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳我作為幽靈屬性的訓練家孰優孰劣，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n要不要用對戰來一決高下？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B362114F5C70BA5E7D97485C6C602776848A137DF45BB65B70512A5B7052A3FF0C00100001BE00000A89814E0D898175285C0D62304F864E006C7A9AD84E0BFF1F00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳準備好具備幽靈屬性的寶可夢時，\n就跟我說一聲吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B4900100003110000FF01014F6059B36E965099597D517750995E7D97485C6C602776845BF653EF59226642FF0C000A5C318DDF62118AAA4E0080725427300200100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳只帶著具有幽靈屬性的寶可夢\n前來一決高下。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B353EA5E368457517767095E7D97485C6C602776845BF653EF5922000A524D4F864E006C7A9AD84E0B300200100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳要和我一決高下，\n看誰是更優秀的幽靈屬性訓練家嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B38981548C62114E006C7A9AD84E0BFF0C000A770B8AB0662F66F4512A79C076845E7D97485C6C60278A137DF45BB655CEFF1F00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一決高下吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E006C7A9AD84E0B5427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9084662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "什麼？<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳帶的都是有幽靈屬性的寶可夢，\n卻不願與我一決高下？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EC09EBCFF1F00100003110000FF01014F6059B35E36768490FD662F67095E7D97485C6C602776845BF653EF5922FF0C000A537B4E0D9858820762114E006C7A9AD84E0BFF1F00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就算速度差<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳一截，\n我也準備了能夠扳回一城的策略！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C317B97901F5EA65DEE00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E00622AFF0C000A62114E5F6E9650994E8680FD5920627356DE4E0057CE76847B567565FF0100100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "輸了……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8F384E862026202600100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "以防在速度上輸給了對手時，\n我還讓寶可夢攜帶了詛咒之符<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n提高了幽靈屬性的威力呢……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EE596325728901F5EA64E0A8F387D664E865C0D624B6642FF0C000A621190848B935BF653EF5922651C5E364E868A5B54924E4B7B2600100001BE00000A63D09AD84E865E7D97485C6C602776845A01529B54622026202600100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真不愧是讓皙白先生與沐淨小姐\n重修舊好的厲害訓練家……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F4E0D6127662F8B937699767D5148751F82076C906DE85C0F59D0000A91CD4FEE820A597D768453B25BB38A137DF45BB62026202600100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯！？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EFFF01FF1F00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……怎麼覺得有一股寒氣……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "20262026600E9EBC89BA5F9767094E0080A15BD26C232026202600100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怎麼了？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "600E9EBC4E86FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我不覺得",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E0D89BA5F970000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳沒感覺到？\n這陰森森的氣息……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n難不成是沐淨小姐的水晶燈火靈\n氣我剛才所說的話，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n正把我的靈魂給吸……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B36C92611F89BA5230FF1F000A9019967068EE68EE76846C23606F2026202600100001BE01000A96E34E0D6210662F6C906DE85C0F59D076846C34667671C8706B9748000A6C236211525B624D62408AAA76848A71FF0C00100001BE00000A6B63628A6211768497489B427D6654382026202600100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不要懲罰我～\n剛才那是我說錯話了～<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我不要被吸走靈魂哪～<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D898161F27F706211FF5E000A525B624D90A3662F62118AAA932F8A714E86FF5E00100001BE00000A62114E0D898188AB54388D7097489B4254EAFF5E00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊！\n那股陰森森的氣息消失了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF01000A90A380A1967068EE68EE76846C23606F6D8859314E86300200100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對了，即使在沐淨小姐不在的地方，\n也是要迴避皙白先生的話題的……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D4E86FF0C53734F7F57286C906DE85C0F59D04E0D57287684573065B9FF0C000A4E5F662F89818FF4907F7699767D5148751F76848A71984C76842026202600100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "讓寶可夢攜帶詛咒之符，\n就能提高幽靈屬性招式威力。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我把這個詛咒之符交給<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳離開吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B935BF653EF5922651C5E368A5B54924E4B7B26FF0C000A5C3180FD63D09AD85E7D97485C6C602762DB5F0F5A01529B300200100001BE00000A6211628A9019500B8A5B54924E4B7B264EA47D6600100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF0C00100001BE00000A8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B396E2958B5427300200100002011401650000",
